  destinations:
  - destinationName: Daisy Field
    description: 'Welcome to Daisy Field, where colorful blooms stretch as far as
      the eye can see.

      A gentle breeze carries the sweet scent of fresh flowers
      through the open meadows.

      Hidden surprises await among winding paths
      and vibrant blossoms.

      Take your first steps into a peaceful adventure
      filled with charm and discovery.'
    background: {fileID: -5529835088768909531, guid: 5ead41110dd1a4ad0a0b360f79ab0168, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Butterfly Garden
    description: 'Thousands of beautiful butterflies dance gracefully above blooming
      gardens.

      Every path is lined with colorful flowers and peaceful resting
      spots.

      Keep exploring to uncover hidden treasures tucked beneath nature''s
      beauty.

      A magical journey begins with every fluttering wing.'
    background: {fileID: 8122833037930648595, guid: d54865927a8fb4caf83ebd9a9c78a27e, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Windmill Farm
    description: 'Rolling fields and towering windmills create the perfect countryside
      escape.

      Golden crops sway gently beneath the bright blue sky.

      Explore
      rustic pathways while solving exciting challenges along the way.

      Every
      corner of the farm hides a delightful surprise.'
    background: {fileID: 9068621135088790376, guid: f7c8966b95c244ddb95ffd43e61fd741, type: 3}
  - destinationName: Sunflower Path
    description: 'Walk through endless rows of glowing sunflowers reaching toward
      the sunshine.

      Warm summer breezes guide your adventure along peaceful
      country trails.

      Bright petals hide sparkling rewards waiting to be discovered.

      Every
      step feels like a celebration of nature.'
    background: {fileID: -2216102210296003592, guid: feed6bc460a0c4fc592ec4b533676489, type: 3}
